        "id": "lem-robbins-siegmund-almost-supermartingale",
        "kind": "lemma",
        "title": "Robbins–Siegmund almost-supermartingale convergence",
        "statement": "Assume AC. If nonnegative adapted integrable X_k and predictable nonnegative integrable b_k satisfy E[X_{k+1}|F_k] ≤ (1+a_k)X_k − b_k + c_k for deterministic nonnegative summable a_k,c_k, then X_k converges almost surely and Σ b_k is finite almost surely.",
