        "id": "thm-stochastic-gradient-nonconvex-randomized-iterate-bound",
        "kind": "theorem",
        "title": "Nonconvex SGD stationarity bound for a uniform randomized iterate",
        "statement": "For an L-smooth function bounded below and an unbiased stochastic gradient with bounded conditional variance, a constant-step SGD trajectory has expected squared gradient at a uniform randomized iterate at most 2(f(x_0)−f_inf)/(αN)+Lασ² when α≤1/L.",
