        "id": "thm-stochastic-gradient-biased-noise-floor",
        "kind": "theorem",
        "title": "Biased SGD has an explicit weighted stationarity floor",
        "statement": "For L-smooth f bounded below, conditional mean bias bounded by β_k, conditional variance bounded by σ_k², and steps α_k≤1/(4L), SGD satisfies an explicit weighted squared-gradient bound with separate bias and variance sums.",
