      {
        "id": "thm-stochastic-gradient-strong-convex-diminishing-step-rate",
        "kind": "theorem",
        "title": "Last-iterate SGD rate for smooth strongly convex objectives",
        "statement": "For an unconstrained L-smooth μ-strongly convex f with ∇f(x*)=0 and uniformly bounded conditional second moment M², the specified diminishing steps give E||x_k−x*||²≤M²/(μ²k) and E[f(x_k)−f*]≤LM²/(2μ²k) for k≥1.",
