      {
        "id": "thm-projected-stochastic-gradient-convex-average-bound",
        "kind": "theorem",
        "title": "Finite-time projected SGD bound for a convex objective",
        "statement": "For convex differentiable f minimized on a closed convex set C of diameter D, an unbiased projected stochastic gradient with conditional second moment at most G² satisfies E[f(x̄_N)−f*]≤DG/√N when α=D/(G√N), with zero-diameter and zero-moment cases treated separately.",
